> [If][ you][ are][ going][ to][ be][ at][ I][STE][ in][ Denver][ this][ year][,][ come][ join][ coffee][ED][U][ one][ morning][.][ Coffee][ED][U][ (][co][ffee][ED][U][.][org][)][ is][ a][ ONE][ H][OUR][ meet][ up][ of][ educators][ in][ the][ style][ of][ ed][camp][.][
