=== Text #4 ===
> [Almost][ every][ business][ is][ driven][ by][ technology][ and][ companies][ need][ skilled][ employees][ to][ fill][ their][ IT][ positions][.][ You][ can][ embark][ on][ a][ new][ and][ exciting][ career][ in][ the][ computer][ and][ networking][ field][ by][ completing][ the][ Network][ Administrator][ program][ at][ tri][OS][ College][.][
