=== Text #6 ===
> [I][ gave][ a][ talk][ on][ the][ Future][ of][ Relations][hips][ to][ the][ Wh][ol][istic][ Business][ Network][ last][ night][.][ Lots][ of][ interesting][ questions][ and][ interaction][.][ As][ we][ are][ going][ through][ a][ period][ of][ Chaos][ as][ the][ old][ Domin][ator][ systems][ break][ down][...][ it][ can][ be][ comforting][ to][ know][ that][ this][ is][ just][ part][ and][ parcel][ of][ the][ evolution][ of][ consciousness][...][and][ will][ emerge][ into][ new][ more][ complex][ and][ egalitarian][ ways][ of][ relating][.]

=== Text #7 ===
> [Getting][ a][ medal][ion][ for][ doing][ well][ on][ the][ M][SA][ test][ is][ both][ a][ great][ award][ and][ a][ great][ incentive][.][ The][ children][ receiving][ the][ medal][ion][ wear][ it][ with][ pride][ and][ those][ seeing][ the][ award][ definitely][ want][ to][ earn][ one][.][ The][ medal][ions][ were][ such][ a][ success][ last][ year][,][ that][ we][ wanted][ to][ use][ them][ again][ this][ year][;][ and][ have][ decided][ to][ make][ the][ presentation][ of][ this][ prestigious][ looking][ award][ part][ of][ our][ M][SA][ program][.]

